Honor declared SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH for generated build metadata only.
Source: Microsoft/SymCrypt 286762b7730e2b780678f5ab11fef2b1bad639e0.
Absent the variable, preserve upstream wall-clock behavior. Runtime entropy,
integrity-key generation and FIPS postprocessing are unchanged.
